across\n50\t  clusters or across projects\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Given a user viewing the runs list, when they select two or more runs and\n55\t  open the comparison, then the parameters and metrics of all selected runs\n56\t  are displayed side by side.\n57\t- Given two runs selected in the comparison view, when the user opens the\n58\t  diff view, then the parameters and metrics that changed between the two\n59\t  runs are highlighted.\n60\t- Given runs produced by Data Science Pipelines, when included in a\n61\t  comparison, then their parameters and metrics render correctly with no\n62\t  change to the pipelines component (passive-component validation).\n63\t- Comparisons remain within a single project; cross-project and cross-cluster\n64\t  comparison are rejected or unavailable.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters\n69\t  and metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n70\t- HLR-3 (P1): run \"diff\" view highlighting which parameters and metrics\n71\t  changed between two selected runs — bundled with HLR-1 because it shares\n72\t  the same comparison UI surface and data; splitting would duplicate that\n73\t  surface.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d4578c2638374ef","agent_id":"a323b47d8b99a5376","session_id":"9bb5fe31-bb26-4b25-8636-7ccb06221853","uuid":"f3e38b66-48ff-45c1-93a5-fd2d587406da","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:59:22.798Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-894067168c84f54f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
